              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kam J"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! Took the advice of some reviews and did decreased the sugar from 3/4 cup to 1/2 cup, plenty of sweetness with reduced sugar. I did use a milk chocolate stirring spoon so that I added extra chocolate throughout my drinking adventure very yummy. I will have to try this recipe out on the family I think it's a winner :)",
