            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kittriss"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It's great, the original recipe is delicious! I would say easily double or triple the recipe. Second go around I did 3 cups of milk and one cup of eggnog instead of cream, along with four cloves soaking in the eggnog for the entire cooking time. Came out great I do think I'll add more salt next time",
