            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "karen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I’ve made this at least 5 times now and it never disappoints! It is so creamy and delicious. It’s definitely my go-to hot chocolate recipe now. I do cut back a bit on the sugar but other than that I don’t change anything :)",
            "datePublished": "2025-11-30T00:55:05.305Z"
